    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <h2 class="giant"><span class="chrome">It’s time to</span><br><span class="chrome">wake up</span><br><span class="red">the heart.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="side">
          <div class="panel"><b class="red">Red</b><p>is the feeling.</p></div>
          <div class="panel"><b style="color:#5b6068">Black</b><p>is the unknown.</p></div>
          <div class="panel"><b class="chrome">Silver</b><p>is the connection.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="last">The Awakening introduced the heart. Wake the Heart gives it power.</p>
    </div>
