<!-- ============================== WAKE THE HEART ============================== -->
<div class="view" data-view="wake" hidden>
  <section class="wake-top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="wk-head">
        <h1 class="giant"><span class="chrome">Wake the</span> <span class="red">Heart.</span></h1>
        <span class="stamp">14 weeks · Nov 9 to Feb 8</span>
      </div>
      <div class="why">
        <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 6px">Why Wake the Heart</p>
        <p class="why-lead">Wake the Heart is about what happens when we let ourselves feel something—and let that feeling reach another person. Across fourteen weeks, I’m sharing songs about the things we carry, the words we struggle to say, and the moments that remind us we’re still here. Each week opens another part of that story. I hope you hear something of yourself in it and feel a little less alone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

