<!-- ============================== WORK ============================== -->
<div class="view" data-view="work" hidden>
  <section class="help-sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="help-top">
        <div>
          <h1 class="giant"><span class="chrome">How can I</span> <span class="red">help?</span></h1>
          <p class="help-lead">Need a hand with a document, some writing, a presentation, or a spreadsheet? Tell me what you’re working on and where you’re stuck. I’ll take a look and let you know how I can help.</p>
          <a class="btn red" href="#help-form">Tell me what you need</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="help-kinds">
        <li class="panel"><b>Sort out a document</b>Letters, forms, flyers, résumés, or something that needs cleaning up.</li>
        <li class="panel"><b>Find the right words</b>Bios, descriptions, social posts, proofreading, and editing.</li>
        <li class="panel"><b>Put a presentation together</b>Organize your ideas into clear, readable slides.</li>
        <li class="panel"><b>Organize the details</b>Typing, lists, records, spreadsheets, and simple trackers.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="help-form-wrap" id="help-form">
        <form class="f js-order panel help-form" novalidate>
          <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 4px">Tell me what you need</p>
          <label for="h-name">Your name — optional<input id="h-name" type="text" autocomplete="name"></label>
          <label for="h-email">Your email<input id="h-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
          <label for="h-kind">What would you like help with?
            <select id="h-kind"><option value="">Choose one</option><option>Sort out a document</option><option>Find the right words</option><option>Put a presentation together</option><option>Organize the details</option><option>Something else</option></select></label>
          <label for="h-about">Tell me a little about it<textarea id="h-about"></textarea></label>
          <label for="h-when">When do you need it? — optional<input id="h-when" type="text" placeholder="A date, or “no rush”"></label>
          <button class="btn red" type="submit">Send my request</button>
          <p class="note">I’ll reply by email to explain what I can help with, the timing, and any cost before we start.</p>
          <p class="ok" hidden>Thanks, your request is in. (Prototype: on the real site this goes to the GhostHeart business inbox.)</p>
        </form>
        <div class="help-side">
          <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 6px">Rather email?</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 18px"><a href="mailto:signal@myghostheart.com">signal@myghostheart.com</a></p>
          <details class="more panel">
            <summary>Service details and prices</summary>
            <div class="tablewrap"><table>
            <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Data entry and typing</td><td class="p chrome">$20/hr</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Word: letter, flyer, form, or fixing a messy document</td><td class="p chrome">$25</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Resume</td><td class="p chrome">$25</td></tr>
              <tr><td>PowerPoint deck, up to 10 slides</td><td class="p chrome">$50</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Excel sheet or simple tracker</td><td class="p chrome">$35</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Writing: bio, product description, social posts</td><td class="p chrome">$25</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Proofreading and editing</td><td class="p chrome">$15/page</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div>
            <p class="note">I’ll email you the total first. You only pay once you agree to it.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="song-opt panel">
        <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 4px">A song from your story</p>
        <p style="margin:0;color:var(--silver)">I also write custom songs for people, memories, and occasions that matter to you.</p>
        <details class="more">
          <summary>Find out about a custom song</summary>
          <ol class="mini-steps">
            <li><b>Tell me your story.</b> Who it’s for, the occasion, and a few memories. Free.</li>
            <li><b>Free preview.</b> Within 2 days I email you the song title and the first 2 lines.</li>
            <li><b>Love it? Pay $50.</b> Pay through Stripe. You owe nothing until you choose the full song.</li>
            <li><b>Your song in 7 days.</b> The finished song, the lyrics as a keepsake, and one small fix if you need it.</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="note">Christmas songs: order by Sunday, Dec 13 for delivery by Sunday, Dec 20.</p>
          <form class="f js-order" novalidate>
            <label for="o-who">Who is the song for?<input id="o-who" type="text"></label>
            <label for="o-occ">What’s the occasion?<input id="o-occ" type="text"></label>
            <label for="o-story">Your story<textarea id="o-story"></textarea></label>
            <label for="o-email">Your email<input id="o-email" type="email" autocomplete="email"></label>
            <button class="btn ghost" type="submit">Send for my free preview</button>
            <p class="ok" hidden>Prototype only. On the real site this goes to the order inbox, same as today.</p>
          </form>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ============================== PROJECTS (carried over from GhostHeart_Projects.html, same words) ============================== -->
<div class="view" data-view="projects" hidden>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="pagehead proj-head">
        <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 6px">GhostHeart Studios / Projects</p>
        <h1><span class="chrome">Build something</span> <span class="red">that helps.</span></h1>
        <p>The songs make room for a feeling. These projects ask what a person might need next: a clearer choice, a private place to reflect, or a way to create.</p>
        <p class="mono" style="margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--mute)">Real people. Their own words. Their own next step.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="proj">
        <article class="proj-card panel">
          <p class="mono k">01 / A tool for the next move <span class="pill on">Available on Google Play</span></p>
          <h2>Axiomara.</h2>
          <p class="lead">When everything feels urgent, find one move you can actually make.</p>
          <p>Axiomara brings goals, tasks, time, energy, notes, and the context you choose into planning you can inspect. Ask what to do next, make the step smaller, or compare paths before you decide.</p>
          <p>It is designed to help a crowded day feel more manageable and to leave the choice in your hands.</p>
          <ul class="trio"><li><b>Bring the reality</b>Goals. Time. Energy.</li><li><b>See the reason</b>A move you can inspect.</li><li><b>Keep the control</b>Accept it. Change it. Choose again.</li></ul>
          <a class="btn red" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ghostheart5.chronospark" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore Axiomara on Google Play ↗</a>
          <p class="note">A planning and decision tool for adults; it does not replace professional or emergency support.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="proj-card panel">
          <p class="mono k">02 / A space for your own words <span class="pill">In progress</span></p>
          <h2>Shadow Fire.</h2>
          <p class="lead">A private place to notice what you carry and decide what belongs in your story.</p>
          <p>Shadow Fire is being built around writing and guided reflection, a Life Book for the pages someone chooses to keep, and Vault controls for reviewing their own records. The aim is to help people see patterns and move at their own pace, with their words and choices under their control.</p>
          <ul class="trio words"><li><b>Write</b></li><li><b>Reflect</b></li><li><b>Choose</b></li></ul>
          <p class="note">In development. There is no public download or live service here yet.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="proj-card panel">
          <p class="mono k">03 / Run the numbers first <span class="pill">In progress</span></p>
          <h2>Deal Vector.</h2>
          <p class="lead">An Android calculator for knowing what is left after the costs, before you commit to a resale deal.</p>
          <p>Enter your expected sale price, what you paid and shipping. Offline USD estimates, before selling fees.</p>
          <ul class="trio words"><li><b>Price</b></li><li><b>Costs</b></li><li><b>Decide</b></li></ul>
          <p class="note">Public release and availability are still pending. No download is offered yet.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="next-up">
        <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 4px">What could come next</p>
        <h2 class="giant"><span class="chrome">Under</span> <span class="red">construction.</span></h2>
        <p style="color:var(--silver);max-width:62ch;margin:6px 0 12px">GhostHeart Studios is exploring more ways to make, play, and carry a story. These are directions, not announced products or launch dates.</p>
        <ul class="help-kinds">
          <li class="panel"><span class="mono">01 / Sound</span><b>Music Studio</b>Room to shape sounds and make something that feels like your own.</li>
          <li class="panel"><span class="mono">02 / Play</span><b>Games</b>Stories and choices you might one day step inside.</li>
          <li class="panel"><span class="mono">03 / Identity</span><b>Brands</b>Visual worlds and identities built with intention.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="measure panel">
        <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 4px">The measure</p>
        <h2 class="giant"><span class="chrome">Make it human.</span> <span class="red">Make it useful.</span></h2>
        <p style="color:var(--silver);margin:6px 0 12px">Ambition matters here. So do privacy, clarity, and the freedom to choose what comes next.</p>
        <div class="row"><a class="btn ghost" href="#support">Find Support</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#connect">Stay Connected</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

