<div class="view" data-view="films" hidden>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="pagehead proj-head">
        <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 6px">Music &amp; films / Watch</p>
        <h1><span class="chrome">Stay With</span> <span class="red">the Story.</span></h1>
        <p>Music videos, lyric videos and cinematic remakes. Twelve films. Pick one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="films">
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AOCRvtz92JM" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/AOCRvtz92JM.jpg" alt="This Is GhostHeart" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">01 · Meet GhostHeart</p><h3>This Is GhostHeart</h3><p>The name, the scars, and the reason a hidden heart chose to be seen.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AOCRvtz92JM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#story">Read the story</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mBAsUNX3vHQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/mBAsUNX3vHQ.jpg" alt="GhostHeart’s Oath" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">02 · The promise</p><h3>GhostHeart’s Oath</h3><p>The promise to protect the light in others.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mBAsUNX3vHQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ARCFOZSOC_o" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/ARCFOZSOC_o.jpg" alt="Human Too" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">Human After All · cinematic remake</p><h3>Human Too</h3><p>A new cinematic version of Human Too—a GhostHeart song about addiction, judgment, pain, and the person behind every label.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ARCFOZSOC_o" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z-FRCpG9vfw" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/i-wont-pretend.jpg" alt="I Won’t Pretend to Speak for You" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">You’re Not God</p><h3>I Won’t Pretend to Speak for You</h3><p>One marriage began beneath a church-house light, surrounded by every blessing people could give. Two women began with trembling hands and borrowed flowers. Fifty years later, this song asks what a lifetime of love can tell us that appearances cannot.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z-FRCpG9vfw" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2SEng4dmgUc" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/JGTwfFrej-M.jpg" alt="Hey Preacher Man" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">You’re Not God</p><h3>Hey Preacher Man</h3><p>A direct answer to the judgment that tried to define a life from the outside.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2SEng4dmgUc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ptYn4vh6DCQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/pJFJXPAiPto.jpg" alt="That Ain’t Holy" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">You’re Not God · Lyric video</p><h3>That Ain’t Holy</h3><p>Mercy should not check your pockets at the door. A father-and-son story about poverty, dignity, and who gets judged.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ptYn4vh6DCQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_mUU-toMlM8" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/_mUU-toMlM8.jpg" alt="The Man Beneath the Moon" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">Broken Man</p><h3>The Man Beneath the Moon</h3><p>A GhostHeart film about the life behind the name.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_mUU-toMlM8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cBNxq4y1ahU" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/cBNxq4y1ahU.jpg" alt="The Dad I Never Had" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">Lyric video</p><h3>The Dad I Never Had</h3><p>A promise to become the father the next generation deserves.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cBNxq4y1ahU" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XWmMYqkvdzg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/XWmMYqkvdzg.jpg" alt="Just Not This Morning" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">Ashes &amp; Embers · Track 01</p><h3>Just Not This Morning</h3><p>Survival answers the dark with one more morning.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XWmMYqkvdzg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nVC1kB0MREA" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/nVC1kB0MREA.jpg" alt="Look at Me" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">Ashes &amp; Embers · Track 02</p><h3>Look at Me</h3><p>A demand to be seen clearly instead of reduced to a wound.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nVC1kB0MREA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FaT_Ibrs9Y0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/FaT_Ibrs9Y0.jpg" alt="Rebellion" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">Official music video</p><h3>Rebellion</h3><p>Love doesn’t ask permission to exist.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FaT_Ibrs9Y0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></article>
          <article class="film panel"><a class="th" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9sbFgjM_SDE" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/films/cruel.jpg" alt="Cruel" loading="lazy"><span>▶</span></a><div><p class="mono k">GhostHeart’s Awakening · Official music video</p><h3>Cruel</h3><p>The full public music video.</p><div class="row"><a class="btn red" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9sbFgjM_SDE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube ↗</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#music">Listen to Cruel</a></div></div></article>
      </div>
